>> numbers := ['1,2,3'] aqsam: [','].
Ħruġ ikteb: ['I got: '] + numbers għodd + [' numbers.'],linja-ġdida.
{ :i Ħruġ ikteb: ['number #'] + i + [':'] + (numbers pożizzjoni: i), linja-ġdida.} × 3.
>> beverages := ['Tea Or Coffee Or Milk Or Orange Juice Or Water'].
beverages := beverages aqsam: [' Or '].
Ħruġ ikteb: ['We serve'], linja-ġdida.
{ :i Ħruġ ikteb: ['->'] + (beverages pożizzjoni: i), linja-ġdida. } × (beverages għodd).
Ħruġ ikteb: (beverages għaqqad: [',']), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: (numbers għaqqad: ['||']).
